 that. It doesn't bother me as much anymore when there are items in the array.\n\nI'd also change the 'Add Element' button text to 'Add Preset'. Not sure if that's part of this PR, but it could be part of this design... idk the code behind this.\n\nDidn't check the code.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117096#pullrequestreview-3992540408","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117096","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117096#pullrequestreview-3992540408"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117096"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-23T15:17:21Z","commit_id":"7ddb6e35f2b8f417bbbb3994ec322fa792eeea46"}]